  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_00550e3e-64ea-4d75-9e83-a68fe719ed94": "Doctor Weiss: But, General... that's not all. These anomalies seem to emit strong radio waves around 11.2 and 11.4 MHz. Also...",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_0074d87f-6d8a-4524-8825-f570399e0a8f": "General McGrew: I said dismissed, Doctor. What are you still doing here?",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_1f35a7e1-f8f9-4d0f-97f5-cf7d02487ecf": "General McGrew: Further orders will be given down the line. That is all. Thank you, gentlemen. Dismissed.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_26673de3-6076-486e-b04d-d3f5f4563d97": "General McGrew: And if you are lucky, you will be able to explain to the Senators why you vaporized 200 million dollars in taxpayer money in one big lightshow. Dismissed.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_32b82ffc-7dd2-43a1-b53f-9edf2d959f33": "Knox Quarantine Briefing",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_33895f6c-b6bf-4315-8c2e-3df535cdbadc": "General McGrew: What do you mean by that, Doctor? DROPKICK failed spectacularly, as we saw two days ago.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_37ee1f84-4300-446f-b0da-8be34aa0ef4b": "General McGrew: As of now, the President has decided to initiate martial law until this crisis is resolved.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_5f4bdf8f-fbb7-49c7-97ef-ef2f45a28626": "<Static sound of a door closing. A phone is dialed>",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_60d80990-2f31-4720-8785-8fe5ad40bf4d": "<Static crackle of shifting chairs and the sound of a door>",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_64312303-f278-4fe4-8e6f-c474b728f4d5": "General McGrew: What do you mean, sightings? DROPKICK was supposed to solve this mess, and all we have now is a pile of molten metal.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_643de4eb-cb81-4cb8-8fb5-f16d2f8e77b4": "General McGrew",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_6630de8a-96f4-4dd0-b8e1-fcea4f5c8f2a": "Doctor Weiss: Yes, sir, but... these sightings. They contain the same substance we used for DROPKICK. They also seem to react to the infection.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_66a33cfb-3e7c-4b7f-b300-53b0590b8d89": "General McGrew: Doctor, I am in the middle of a national crisis. I have no time for this nonsense.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_685dac19-a91f-4560-b1df-0a95ef9604dd": "General McGrew: All local military units are authorized weapons free. No infected are allowed to leave the Zone.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_7e52f2fb-c7a2-4b6e-84fd-2431d0f5b590": "General McGrew: This is McGrew. Get me Washington.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_8212ceca-d7d5-49f7-916a-664f716fce4c": "General McGrew: As you all know, as of 0900 this morning, I ordered the complete quarantine of Knox Country.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_98780f2d-e91c-4f44-85c5-b53f5fe8b769": "General McGrew: Dismissed!",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_b7a6b375-d82c-45c0-a55e-12269c9d7510": "Doctor Weiss: But General, I-",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_b98dbe27-1764-4f53-b1f7-b0ac7665f19b": "General McGrew: Doctor, let me make myself clear. DROPKICK is your responsibility. Fix it. ASAP.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_ba6a5404-b3f9-4ce0-9fca-66cd31b5c841": "VHS: Knox Quarantine Briefing",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_eec46f81-ab15-441a-bd03-7f2bb1329f98": "Doctor Weiss: General... it's about DROPKICK.",
  "translate_en|mods/Toxic Sky Anomalies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_f0875653-c766-47de-a40f-f258f02944f6": "Doctor Weiss: Sir... that is not entirely correct. We are getting reports from all over the country of... sightings.",
